	"getSecondaryTransaction": {
		"description": "Scope(s): `read_issuer_secondarytransactions` OR `readwrite_issuer_secondarytransactions`\n\nRetrieves the full secondary transaction, nested under `secondaryTransaction` in the response: its current state, and one entry per security carrying that security's settlement outcome and — for option grants, once the issuer has approved option cost — its tax reference.\n\nOption grants carry no `taxReference` until the issuer approves option cost, because Carta's estimate can still change in review; see `taxReference` for the states in which it appears. Once present, it is the final withholding the issuer approved, which Carta settles with.\n\nRead the issuer-approved tax withholding figures here before moving money. Finalize Secondary Transaction also returns them, but by then the money has already moved. Each tax line carries a `withholdingAmount` and an `exerciseCost`; aggregate the lines yourself, as there is no summary block. Net proceeds to the seller are the sale amount less the exercise cost and withholding, aggregated across securities.\n\nThese figures are informational reference only. Carta moves no money — you use them to calculate the net proceeds owed to the seller and to determine your withholding obligations before releasing payment.\n\nA line on which no jurisdiction withholds returns a `taxReference` whose `taxLineItems` array is **empty**, not a line item with a zero amount. That is common for an ISO line, but not universal: a jurisdiction that withholds on an ISO exercise (e.g. Pennsylvania) returns line items for it. Handle the empty array rather than assuming at least one line item is present.",
		"inputSchema": {
			"additionalProperties": false,
			"examples": [
				{
					"issuerId": "101",
					"secondaryTransactionId": "101"
				}
			],
			"properties": {
				"issuerId": {
					"anyOf": [
						{
							"maximum": 9007199254740991,
							"minimum": 0,
							"type": "integer"
						},
						{
							"maxLength": 64,
							"minLength": 1,
							"pattern": "^[A-Za-z0-9_-]+$",
							"type": "string"
						}
					],
					"description": "The identifier of the issuer the transaction belongs to."
				},
				"secondaryTransactionId": {
					"anyOf": [
						{
							"maximum": 9007199254740991,
							"minimum": 0,
							"type": "integer"
						},
						{
							"maxLength": 64,
							"minLength": 1,
							"pattern": "^[A-Za-z0-9_-]+$",
							"type": "string"
						}
					],
					"description": "Carta's identifier for the transaction to retrieve, as returned by Create Secondary Transaction."
				}
			},
			"required": [
				"issuerId",
				"secondaryTransactionId"
			],
			"type": "object"
		}
	},
