	"getStakeholderEquitySummary": {
		"description": "Scope(s): `read_issuer_securities` OR `readwrite_issuer_securities`\n\nRetrieves a summary of a stakeholder's equity positions — certificates, option grants (ISO and NSO), restricted stock awards, and restricted stock units — at a given issuer.\n\nCovers 4 security types. Warrants, convertible notes, SARs, CBUs, and PIUs are not included.",
